# App version bump

Before every `git commit`, run `npm run version:bump` and stage `lib/app-version.ts` in the same commit.

The stamp is `YYYYMMDD-HHMM` (local time) shown under «Abmelden» in the sidebar. Never ship a commit that leaves a stale version.

A repo pre-commit hook in `.githooks/pre-commit` also bumps it when hooks run; still bump explicitly so agent commits stay correct if hooks are skipped.
